{'symbol': 'LIN', 'date': '2022-07-25 13:15:00', 'title': 'LINDE DECLARES DIVIDEND IN THIRD QUARTER 2022', 'text': 'WOKING, UK / ACCESSWIRE / JULY 25, 2022 / LINDE PLC (NYSE:LIN; FWB:LIN) ANNOUNCED ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $1.17 PER SHARE. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON SEPTEMBER 16, 2022 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON SEPTEMBER 2, 2022.'}